Standardize reference unit strings to the schema's target units.

Uses fuzzy matching to detect variant spellings (e.g. \code{'mmhg'} vs \code{'mmHg'},
\code{'10*3/ul'} vs \code{'10^3/uL'}) and rewrites them to the canonical unit defined
in the schema. This does \strong{not} convert values between different unit
systems; unmatched units are reported as warnings.
